sentences.text:
The present application is filed for seeking following prayers:-
"(A) Your Lordships be pleased to admit and allow the present application;
(B) Your Lordships be pleased to quash the impugned FIR being C.R.I 136 of 2016 registered with the Fatehganj Police R/CR.MA/33581/2016 ORDER DATED:
19/06/2023 Station District: Vadodara and all further proceedings in pursuance thereto qua the present applicants;
(C) Your Lordships be pleased to stay the investigation and further proceedings thereto of the FIR being C.R.I 136 of 2016 registered with the Fatehganj Police Dineshbhai Jagjigandas Parekh vs State Of Gujarat on 19 June, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/182266800/
